{"id":"630594","name":"西多士","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/630594/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"吐司面包","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"三个"},{"name":"纯牛奶","amount":"30克"}],"sub":[{"name":"炼乳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花生酱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"吐司面包切成2cm左右的厚片。","img":"images/630594/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去掉吐司边边。","img":"images/630594/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切成小方块(也可以不切，就煎一块大的)。","img":"images/630594/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备好鸡蛋。","img":"images/630594/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入30克纯牛奶，划散。","img":"images/630594/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取一片吐司片，抹上花生酱。","img":"images/630594/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再合上一片吐司片，两两一组。","img":"images/630594/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"六面都沾满蛋液。","img":"images/630594/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入盘中待用。","img":"images/630594/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"起锅烧油，油稍宽。","img":"images/630594/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"油四成热时，下入吐司片炸(也可以少放些油煎香也是可以的)。","img":"images/630594/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"全程小火，炸至两面金黄。","img":"images/630594/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"捞出，沥干油。","img":"images/630594/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"淋上炼乳或蜂蜜。","img":"images/630594/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/630594/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"一口一个，超过瘾。","img":"images/630594/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/630594/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/630594/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"来一个哦😁😁","img":"images/630594/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}